fication of 26 Letters. Our goal is to map images from a particular  domain to a Letter that it means. We will be finetuning (transfer learning) existing models that  perform classification on RGB images. We will Look at the levels of RGB images in Particular  Centroidal Pixels and We can Classify from the Centre Which Shape is Defined. We are Planing to  Use RESNET - Residual Neural Networks or Similar to be able to argue and analyze the better  Accuracy between all of the Networks. ","topics":[],"score":224767,"global_rank":150558},{"name":"YanjunLin-Andrie/nba_draft_analysis","owner":"YanjunLin-Andrie","html_url":"https://github.com/YanjunLin-Andrie/nba_draft_analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Experiments for Project 1","topics":[],"score":224767,"global_rank":150566},{"name":"u-will/text-classifier","owner":"u-will","html_url":"https://github.com/u-will/text-classifier","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224764,"global_rank":150590},{"name":"temilaj/opencv-object-detection","owner":"temilaj","html_url":"https://github.com/temilaj/opencv-object-detection","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Computer Vision - Object Detection with OpenCV and Python","topics":[],"score":224764,"global_rank":150596},{"name":"hfmandell/ML-Practice","owner":"hfmandell","html_url":"https://github.com/hfmandell/ML-Practice","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Various tutorials & small projects from online resources","topics":[],"score":224764,"global_rank":150607}]